(We need OA linked for activation and later for authorize. So we need OA linked from attach through authorize. So we cannot detach OA before authorize. Thus we cannot attach DA while OA is linked. So we need to either use a different route_task_profile for DA, but we only have one. So we need to detach OA after we are done with OA's need for task profile (i.e., after authorize). Then we can attach DA.)
(Thus we need to reorder: do OA attach, confirm, activate, keep linked, then authorize transport leg (needs OA linked), then detach OA. After that, we can attach DA, confirm, activate, detach DA.)
(Thus sequence:)
(- attach OA)
(- confirm OA)
(- activate OA)
(- assign operator OA)
(- lock OA)
(- release operator OA)
(- (keep OA linked))
(- assemble transport leg)
(- authorize transport leg loading (requires OA linked))
(- detach OA)
(Now after detach OA, RT profile becomes available again.)
(Now we can process destination:)
(- attach DA)
(- confirm DA)
(- activate DA)
(- assign operator DA)
(- lock DA)
(- release operator DA)
(- detach DA (optional, but we may need it later for dispatch? For origin dispatch we need OA task profile again later; for destination we don't need task profile again. So we can detach after lock, not needed later.))
(Now after that, we have RT profile available.)
(Now we need to attach to shift_candidate_alpha for its processing (staging, skill, operator, compliance, finalize, allocate dispatch slot, execute dispatch). We'll keep it linked throughout shift processing, then detach after dispatch.)
(Thus after destination processing, we have RT profile available.)
(Now attach shift_candidate_alpha, confirm, then proceed with loading etc.)
(Thus we need to adjust ordering of vehicle allocation etc.)
(Let's list all actions in order with tracking.)
(We'll also need to allocate vehicles before any attach that requires vehicle_allocated.)
(Thus:)
(1. create_candidate origin_availability_alpha)
(2. create_candidate destination_availability_alpha)
(3. create_candidate shift_candidate_alpha)
(4. create_candidate shift_candidate_beta)
(5. allocate_vehicle_unit origin_availability_alpha vehicle_unit_alpha)
(6. allocate_vehicle_unit destination_availability_alpha vehicle_unit_beta)
(7. allocate_vehicle_unit shift_candidate_alpha vehicle_unit_gamma)
(Now we have vehicles allocated.)
(Now process origin:)
(8. attach_task_profile origin_availability_alpha route_task_profile_alpha)
(9. confirm_candidate_preparedness origin_availability_alpha route_task_profile_alpha)
(10. activate_origin_node origin_availability_alpha origin_node_alpha route_task_profile_alpha)
(// keep OA linked)
(Now assign operator to origin:)
(11. assign_operator_resource origin_availability_alpha driver_operator_alpha)
(12. lock_origin_availability origin_availability_alpha origin_node_alpha driver_operator_alpha)
(13. release_operator_resource origin_availability_alpha driver_operator_alpha)
(Now we have OA locked and confirmed.)
(Now assemble transport leg:)
(14. assemble_transport_leg origin_availability_alpha destination_availability_alpha origin_node_alpha destination_node_alpha transport_leg_alpha)
(Now authorize transport leg loading:)
(15. authorize_transport_leg_loading transport_leg_alpha origin_availability_alpha route_task_profile_alpha)
(Now we can detach OA task profile (since we no longer need it for OA):)
(16. detach_task_profile origin_availability_alpha route_task_profile_alpha)
(Now RT profile available.)
(Now process destination:)
(17. attach_task_profile destination_availability_alpha route_task_profile_alpha)
(18. confirm_candidate_preparedness destination_availability_alpha route_task_profile_alpha)
(19. activate_destination_node destination_availability_alpha destination_node_alpha route_task_profile_alpha)
(20. assign_operator_resource destination_availability_alpha driver_operator_alpha)
(21. lock_destination_availability destination_availability_alpha destination_node_alpha driver_operator_alpha)
(22. release_operator_resource destination_availability_alpha driver_operator_alpha)
(23. detach_task_profile destination_availability_alpha route_task_profile_alpha)
(Now RT profile available again.)
(Now process shift_candidate_alpha:)
(We need candidate_prepared shift_candidate_alpha. We have not yet attached task profile or confirmed. So:)
(24. attach_task_profile shift_candidate_alpha route_task_profile_alpha)
(25. confirm_candidate_preparedness shift_candidate_alpha route_task_profile_alpha)
(// keep linked for subsequent steps)
(Now load container onto leg requires transport_leg_assembled and transport_leg_loading_authorized (we have from steps 14 and 15). Also requires loading_container_available loading_container_alpha (still available). Good.)
(26. load_container_onto_leg shift_candidate_alpha loading_container_alpha transport_leg_alpha)
(Now loading_container_loaded true, loading_container_leg_linked true.)
(Now stage schedule candidate:)
(27. stage_schedule_candidate shift_candidate_alpha loading_container_alpha transport_leg_alpha route_task_profile_alpha)
(// requires candidate_prepared (true), candidate_loading_container_linked (true), loading_container_loaded (true), loading_container_leg_linked (true), candidate_task_profile_linked (true), not origin_leg_loaded (true), not candidate_staged_for_loading (true))
(Now assign skill certificate:)
(28. assign_skill_certificate shift_candidate_alpha skill_certificate_alpha)
(Now assign operator to shift_candidate_alpha (operator is free after we released from destination):)
(29. assign_operator_resource shift_candidate_alpha driver_operator_alpha)
(Now verify loading profile nominal:)
(30. verify_loading_profile_nominal shift_candidate_alpha skill_certificate_alpha driver_operator_alpha loading_container_alpha transport_leg_alpha)
(Now assign compliance certificate:)
(31. assign_compliance_certificate shift_candidate_alpha compliance_certificate_alpha)
(Now establish clearance nominal:)
(32. establish_clearance_nominal shift_candidate_alpha compliance_certificate_alpha loading_container_alpha transport_leg_alpha)
(Now release compliance certificate to make it available:)
(33. release_compliance_certificate shift_candidate_alpha compliance_certificate_alpha)
(Now finalize candidate:)
(34. finalize_candidate_direct shift_candidate_alpha)
(Now allocate dispatch slot for shift_candidate_alpha:)
(35. allocate_dispatch_slot_for_candidate shift_candidate_alpha dispatch_slot_alpha route_task_profile_alpha)
(// requires dispatch_ready (from finalize), task profile linked (still true), dispatch_slot_available (true), not dispatch_allocated (true))
(Now execute schedule dispatch:)
(36. execute_schedule_dispatch shift_candidate_alpha vehicle_unit_gamma dispatch_slot_alpha)
(Now after dispatch, vehicle_unit_gamma becomes available, dispatch_slot_alpha becomes available.)
(Now we can detach shift_candidate_alpha task profile:)
(37. detach_task_profile shift_candidate_alpha route_task_profile_alpha)
(Now RT profile available.)
(Now we need to dispatch origin_availability_alpha.)
(We need origin_availability_alpha dispatch ready: we have origin_availability_locked, origin_availability_confirmed, transport_leg_assembled, transport_leg_loading_authorized (still true). We haven't changed those. So we can mark origin dispatch ready.)
(38. mark_origin_availability_dispatch_ready origin_availability_alpha transport_leg_alpha)
(Now we need to allocate dispatch slot for origin_availability_alpha. Need task profile linked again. So we attach OA task profile:)
(39. attach_task_profile origin_availability_alpha route_task_profile_alpha)
(40. allocate_dispatch_slot_for_candidate origin_availability_alpha dispatch_slot_alpha route_task_profile_alpha)
(41. execute_origin_dispatch origin_availability_alpha vehicle_unit_alpha dispatch_slot_alpha)
(Now after execute_origin_dispatch, vehicle_unit_alpha becomes available, dispatch_slot_alpha becomes available.)
(Now we can detach OA task profile:)
(42. detach_task_profile origin_availability_alpha route_task_profile_alpha)
(Now we have dispatched shift_candidate_alpha and origin_availability_alpha.)
(We also have created shift_candidate_beta (step 4). We have not dispatched it, but goal only requires candidate_created shift_candidate_beta, not dispatched. Good.)
(We have compliance_certificate_available after step 33 (release). Good.)
(We have route_task_profile_available after step 37 and 42 (two detaches). Actually after step 37 we made it available, after step 42 we made it available again (but it was already available). So final it's available.)
(Thus all goals satisfied.)
(Now we need to ensure we didn't miss any preconditions.)
(Let's verify each step's preconditions in order.)
(We'll maintain state mentally.)
